1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,799
There's even a sky garden where you get some nice views of dublin castle from here.
这里甚至还有空中花园，可以从这里欣赏 Dublin Castle 的景色。

2
00:00:05,799 --> 00:00:13,440
Across the city you'll also find trinity college dublin one of the oldest universities in Europe.
在城里另一边，你还会找到 Trinity College Dublin，作者称其为欧洲最古老的大学之一。

3
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:20,200
Entering the university grounds is free but what isn't free is its most famous attraction.
进入大学场地是免费的，但它最著名的景点可不免费。

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,710
This long queue right here is for something called the book of kels.
这里排的长队，是为了一个叫 Book of Kels 的东西。

5
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:31,680
It's a very famous medieval manuscript that's permanently on display here at trinity college.
它是一份很著名的中世纪手稿，在 Trinity College 长期展出。

6
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:38,789
Once you've bought your ticket you'll be shown a very short exhibition before being led into the book of kels.
买票后，你会先看一个很短的展览，然后被引导去看那份手稿。

7
00:00:38,799 --> 00:00:47,200
Now you can't actually take pictures or videos of it and you'll only spend about 30 seconds looking at it before they let you into the old library.
你不能拍照片或视频，而且只能看大约三十秒，然后他们让你进旧图书馆。

8
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,840
Arguably this is the more interesting bit of the tour.
可以说，这才是这次参观更有意思的部分。

9
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:56,479
You get to see this wonderfully old library and it provides some excellent photo opportunities.
你能看到这座美丽的旧图书馆，它也提供了很棒的拍照机会。

10
00:00:56,479 --> 00:01:01,919
More interesting than the book of kel's is this thing right here the brian boru harp.
比 Book of Kel's 更有趣的，是这里这个 Brian Boru Harp。

11
00:01:01,919 --> 00:01:09,760
This is the exact reason why the emblem of ireland is a h and is the inspiration of the guinness logo.
作者说，这正是爱尔兰徽记为竖琴、以及 Guinness 标志灵感的原因。

12
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:20,359
But if I'm being brutally honest this was a total ripoff it costs 1 to see this stuff and you'll be done in literally 20 minutes or less.
但说实话，他觉得这完全不值。字幕把价格记为 1，而他说二十分钟甚至更短就看完了。

13
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:25,960
Especially with the book of kell's bits they usually flick it to a page where there's no artwork it's just text.
尤其是手稿部分，他们通常翻到没有图案、只有文字的一页。

14
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:28,120
And the fact that you can't take pictures of it.
而且你还不能拍照。

15
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:36,760
And you only spend about 30 seconds looking at it you can see it if you want to but if I'm being brutally honest it was a total waste of money.
只能看大约三十秒。你想看也可以，但说实话，作者觉得这完全是浪费钱。

16
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:46,240
If you want more bank for your book head on over to the complete opposite end of the city where you'll find this the kil manum jail.
如果想更划算些，就去城市另一头，那里有字幕记为 Kil Manum Jail 的地方。

17
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:57,880
Okay it's a jail it doesn't sound very interesting in theory but once you consider that people used to be executed here it's kind of creepy and cool at the same time.
好吧，是座监狱。听起来理论上不太有趣，但想到以前有人在此被处决，就既阴森又有点酷。

18
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:02,919
It's definitely a much better attraction to pay for than the book of kels.
他觉得这肯定比 Book of Kels 更值得付费参观。

19
00:02:02,919 --> 00:02:10,920
Whilst you're around there actually try and visit the royal hospital and the royal hospital grounds from the air it's actually quite nice.
在附近时，也可以试着参观 Royal Hospital 及其场地。从空中看，那里其实挺漂亮。

20
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,080
If you're absolutely itching for something else to do dublin is not short on things like museums.
如果你特别想再找点事做，都柏林可不缺博物馆这样的地方。

21
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:22,440
Such as the national wax museum boy that sounds riveting.
例如 National Wax Museum。哇，听起来可真精彩。

22
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:30,680
The irish rock and roll museum experience the little museum of dublin you can learn all about dublin in just 29 minutes.
还有 Irish Rock and Roll Museum Experience、Little Museum of Dublin。作者说，二十九分钟就能了解都柏林。

23
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:35,430
But the one I urge you to go to is the national gallery of ireland.
但他强烈建议去的是 National Gallery of Ireland。

24
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:43,149
Not just because it's free but because you'll find some of the most famous paintings that you probably would have heard heard of or probably seen before.
不只是因为它免费，还因为你会看到一些很有名的画，可能听说过，或者以前见过。

25
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:51,599
You'll find paintings from picasso van goof or van if you want to pronounce it correctly paintings by clae monae.
你会看到 Picasso、字幕记为 Van Goof 或 Van 的作品，以及 Clae Monae 的画。

26
00:02:51,599 --> 00:03:01,080
And you'll even find this famous painting of anne berin I'm not entirely certain why that's here but you know it's cool that I can see it in person.
还会看到一幅字幕记为 Anne Berin 的著名肖像。我不确定它为什么在这，但能亲眼看到很酷。

27
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:07,560
If you're an art lover this will take several hours to see so make some time for that.
如果你喜欢艺术，可能要花几个小时看，所以为它留些时间吧。

28
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:13,320
The other major museum that I highly recommend that you check out is the national archaeological museum.
另一座他很推荐去看看的主要博物馆，是 National Archaeological Museum。

29
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:20,960
It's slightly more historic and definitely less painty but it's definitely worth checking out if you're a fan of museums.
它更偏历史一点，也更少绘画一点，但如果你喜欢博物馆，他觉得很值得看。
